WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.400
Whether to delegate a task depends on your purpose.

2
00:00:04.202 --> 00:00:08.502
First identify whether your goal is learning or completing a task.

3
00:00:09.404 --> 00:00:12.404
Decide which thinking you need to practise yourself.

4
00:00:13.257 --> 00:00:16.957
Delegate only what is appropriate, then check the result.
